{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Explore the vast ocean, survive deadly encounters, and uncover the secrets of a lost island.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adrift in Silence</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/Untitledvideo-MadewithClipchamp5-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1753455081\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ocean is calm. The sky burns orange. You're alone-until the storm hits, and the nightmare begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Something Beneath</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/Untitledvideo-MadewithClipchamp71-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1753455081\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A shadow moves below the waves. Help arrives... and vanishes in an instant. You're not alone out here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Island Wasn't Meant to Be Found</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/Untitledvideo-MadewithClipchamp4-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1753455081\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dragged from the sea to a forgotten land, you wake in a place where nature never moved on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Run, Hide, Survive</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/Untitledvideo-MadewithClipchamp9-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1753455081\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From dense jungles to abandoned labs, you'll search for a way out. But when night falls, it's not just survival-it's escape... or extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a story-driven adventure where every moment is packed with tension and spectacle. From being stranded at sea to battling prehistoric predators, players are taken on a linear yet immersive journey across ocean and island environments. Explore a mysterious sci-fi lab, witness dramatic dinosaur encounters, and make it through high-stakes sequences with limited combat and intense pacing. Your goal: uncover the truth and escape alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cinematic story-driven survival</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic dinosaur and sea creature encounters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open-world island exploration</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sci-fi lab discovery and secrets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense \u201csurvive the night\u201d gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736540?t=1753455081","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736540?t=1753455081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/d06f7f770947a4fa1ae6b0c523b146b6db01b4f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753455081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/d06f7f770947a4fa1ae6b0c523b146b6db01b4f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753455081","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Blood, gore and killing of dinosaurs."},"demos":[{"appid":3807780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Explore the vast ocean, survive deadly encounters, and uncover the secrets of a lost island.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adrift in Silence</stro